From c22ba3278caa0000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:55:14 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] [GLib] Add FrameInfo API

Backported from WebKit c22ba3278caa (2.56): a navigation's source and
target frames, so a navigation policy tells a top-level navigation from
one inside a frame. Ported to 2.54.2 for WPE only: the private header
keeps 2.54's CString frame name, and the GTK and test hunks are left out.

https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=319164

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
